  "source_scope_note": "The selected problem is Theorem 1.5: the exact signed holomorphic Reidemeister-torsion volume formula on the stated open good-SL2 character locus of a freely generated group of rank at least three. The complete author article body retains all local torsion duality, boundary form, SL2 normalization, four-holed-surface bracket and trace-discriminant computations. The overall author sign ambiguity is retained. Other SLN/SL3 statements are context and are not additional counted problems.",
